      <div class="card-ember"><div style="font-size:28px;margin-bottom:14px;">🏡</div><div class="card-title" style="color:var(--ember-800);">Exterior Painting</div><p class="card-body" style="color:var(--ember-700);">Siding, trim, shutters, doors, decks, and fences. Proper pressure wash, primer, and finish coats — with warranties on exterior work.</p></div>
      <div class="card-ember"><div style="font-size:28px;margin-bottom:14px;">🖼️</div><div class="card-title" style="color:var(--ember-800);">Wallpaper</div><p class="card-body" style="color:var(--ember-700);">Installation and removal of wallpaper and grasscloth — detailed assessment of wall condition and proper adhesive and hanging techniques.</p></div>
