      <div class="card-ember"><div style="font-size:28px;margin-bottom:14px;">✨</div><div class="card-title" style="color:var(--ember-800);">Cabinet Refinishing</div><p class="card-body" style="color:var(--ember-700);">Kitchen and bathroom cabinet repainting — sprayed in a controlled environment or on-site, with proper prep for a factory-smooth finish.</p></div>
      <div class="card-ember"><div style="font-size:28px;margin-bottom:14px;">🌊</div><div class="card-title" style="color:var(--ember-800);">Deck & Fence Staining</div><p class="card-body" style="color:var(--ember-700);">Transparent, semi-transparent, and solid stain systems for decks and fences — cleaned, stripped, and properly ready before application.</p></div>
